# Vite & TypeScript

## Tooling

- Vite 8 + `@vitejs/plugin-react`; entry `src/main.tsx` → `AppProviders` → `App`
- Lint with `oxlint`; test with `vitest` (`pnpm test` / `pnpm test:run`)
- Path/env typing via `src/vite-env.d.ts` — extend when adding `VITE_*` vars

## Env

- Copy `.env.example` → `.env.local`
- Only `VITE_`-prefixed vars reach the client
- Guard missing config with `isSupabaseConfigured` / nullable `supabase` from `src/lib/supabase.ts`
- Never put service-role or admin passwords in Vite env

## Code style

- Strict TypeScript; prefer domain types from `src/types/domain.ts` (and generated DB types when wired)
- Keep providers in `src/app/providers.tsx` (QueryClient + BrowserRouter)
- Prefer small, focused modules over deep abstraction layers
- Match existing import style and feature-folder layout
